    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n99633" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύνδεσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>binding together</i>, of milk by fig-juice, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.697b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὴν τῆς κονίας ς</span>.
			so as <i>to bind</i> the mortar or stucco, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				13.113
			</span></i>; <i>continuation</i> of a text, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1737.23
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii/iii A.D.)</span>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς
				ψυχῆς πρὸς [τὸ σῶμα</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Antr.</u>
				14
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοινωνία καὶ ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				32
			</span></i>; <i>connecting link</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				43d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (from 
				Pass.
			) <i>constriction</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ δέρματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					6.3.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Oss.</u>
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				17(2).2
			</span></i>. </div>
